  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "During the extraction of copper, iron is present in the ore as impurity (FeS).\nThe ore together with a little coke and silica is smelted; FeS present as impurity in the ore is oxidized to iron oxide, which then reacts with silica to form fusible ferrous silicate which is removed as slag.\n$2 \\mathrm{FeS}+3 \\mathrm{O}_2 \\rightarrow 2 \\mathrm{FeO}+2 \\mathrm{SO}_2 \\uparrow$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/6cK-T1m2YLKpiMG1exrlR_WDOlXvmbBGKhhiXVWaveI.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
